# README.md and the /panel skill both document `llm-panel - <<'ASK' ... ASK`, but only
# `-f -` was implemented. A bare `-` became the PROMPT, which is non-empty, so the
# read-stdin branch never ran: the heredoc was discarded and a single dash was sent to the
